OL,3,ABoxer Joe Cordina was 'retaliating'
OL,4,Awhen he punched man to ground, court
OL,5,Ahears
OL,6,
OL,7,FCardiff Magistrates' Court heard the
OL,8,Faltercation came to light days later,
OL,9,Fafter a video was published on Wales
OL,10,FOnline, filmed by a witness at a Texaco
OL,11,Fgarage in the Pentwyn area of Cardiff.
OL,13,FO'Brien's sister told police her
OL,14,Fbrother "hated" Cordina, the court was
OL,15,Ftold, and she feared he had "sought
OL,16,Fout" Cordina.
